# Formatting

- Match `.prettierrc`: no semicolons, single quotes, `trailingComma: "es5"`, `arrowParens: "avoid"`, and `prettier-plugin-tailwindcss` (class order from `app/globals.css`).
- After creating or editing source files, run Prettier before finishing:

```bash
npm run format
```

- Or format only touched paths: `npx prettier --write <paths>`
- Do not fight the formatter (manual class reordering, alternate quote/semi style, etc.).
- Keep `npm run lint` clean on changed files; fix issues you introduce.
